      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Why is specialized digital marketing essential for B2B software and SaaS companies?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "B2B tech buying journeys are complex, involving multiple stakeholders, technical evaluations, and 3-to-9-month decision cycles. Specialized digital marketing targets bottom-of-funnel software evaluation keywords, builds technical authority, and nurtures decision-makers until they book a qualified product demo."
